                                "text": "Most architects, although qualified in matters of building materials and structure, are ill-equipped as theatricians. The counsel of an expert in technical theatre may save thousands of dollars in later remedial efforts and may help to ensure that the theatre facility is a place in which responsible theatre may take place."
